    h1 Minimize Food Waste - Tips and Ideas
    p Here are some tips and resources to help you reduce food waste.

    ul
      li Tip 1 - Plan your meals and make a shopping list to avoid buying unnecessary items.
      li Tip 2 - Store food properly to extend its shelf life.
      li Tip 3 - Use leftovers creatively to create new meals.
      li Tip 4 - Compost food scraps instead of throwing them away.

    p Explore these tips and start making small changes to reduce food waste in your life.